# Phase 4 (Bug 3 fix): explicit watcher ignore file for the Tauri
# dev-mode file watcher. See `tauri-cli/src/interface/rust.rs::build_ignore_matcher`
# for the consumer — it loads `.taurignore` from the tauri dir
# (`src-tauri/`) via `add_custom_ignore_filename(".taurignore")`, and
# also loads the default ignore list (`tauri-cli/tauri-dev-watcher.gitignore`:
# node_modules/, target/, gen/, Cargo.lock, .DS_Store).
#
# The primary fix is to write transcripts OUTSIDE `src-tauri/`
# (see `mew-ui/src-tauri/src/lib.rs::run_browser_task` — transcripts
# now go to `app_data_dir()/transcripts/`). This file is a second
# layer of defense in case a future caller accidentally writes a
# transcript under `src-tauri/transcripts/` again: the watcher
# should ignore that path and not rebuild the app.

# mew-agent on-disk transcript logs
transcripts/
